  "releaseNotes": "1.2.1: Fixed Development server discovery. Wildcard listen addresses (+, *, 0.0.0.0, [::])\n\t\t\tfrom ASPNETCORE_URLS are no longer added as Local servers, so the generated document only\n\t\t\tlists URLs that clients can call. Patch release. Requires CoreSystem.OpenApi 2.2.0, which\n\t\t\tchanges the default problem schema names (see its release notes).\n\t\t\t1.2.0: Added ProducesConflictProblemAttribute (HTTP 409) for documenting conflict\n\t\t\tproblem responses. Minor version bump.",
